# The vendored WebShop fork CODE (webshop/) IS committed so miles-agent is
# self-contained (no dependency on any other repo). setup.sh never writes into
# this tree: it rsyncs the code to a writable copy under $WEBSHOP_HOME/webshop
# and downloads the catalog + builds the Lucene index THERE (the only symlink,
# search_engine/indexes -> indexes_<mode>, lives inside that copy). The
# patterns below keep the same heavy/generated artifacts out of git as a
# safety net: an upstream checkout that still carries them, or a setup.sh run
# pointed at this tree via WEBSHOP_VENDOR.
#
# NOTE: gitignore has no inline comments; every pattern is on its own line.

# downloaded catalog (items_*.json)
webshop/data
# Lucene index symlink -> indexes_<mode>
webshop/search_engine/indexes
# index build staging (documents.jsonl) + built Lucene indexes
webshop/search_engine/resources_*/
webshop/search_engine/indexes_*/
# 16 MB Selenium binary, unused by the text env
webshop/web_agent_site/envs/chromedriver
# RL baselines, never imported
webshop/baseline_models/
# runtime session dumps
webshop/user_session_logs/

# caches / local build detritus
__pycache__/
*.pyc
.pytest_cache/
.venv/
uv.lock
